        </div>
        <div class="hero-note">✦ Learn at your own pace &nbsp; ✦ Build real-world skills</div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="visual-card main-visual">
            <div class="visual-top"><span>YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</span><span>✦</span></div>
            <div class="book-icon">📚</div>
