    <div><h2>∞</h2><p>Ways to grow</p></div>
    <div><h2>01</h2><p>First step: you</p></div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="courses">
    <div class="section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR PATH</span>
        <h2>Skills for the world<br><span>you're building.</span></h2>
        <p>Explore a field that excites you and start learning something meaningful.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="course-grid">
        <article class="course-card course-purple">
            <div class="course-icon">⌘</div>
            <span class="course-number">01 / TECHNOLOGY</span>
            <h3>Web Development</h3>
            <p>Turn your ideas into beautiful, functional websites and applications.</p>
            <a href="#register" class="course-link">Start exploring ↗</a>
